{"ref":"BDB, צַ֫עַד","hw":"צַ֫עַד","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">צַ֫עַד</span>]</big>  <strong>n.m.</strong><sup><a data-ref=\"II Samuel 6:13\" href=\"/II_Samuel.6.13\">2 S 6:13</a></sup> <strong>step, pace</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">צָ֑עַד</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 30:29\" href=\"/Proverbs.30.29\">Pr 30:29</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">צַעֲדוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 10:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.10.3\">Je 10:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 16:9\" href=\"/Proverbs.16.9\">Pr 16:9</a>, etc.; pl. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">צַעֲדֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 18:7\" href=\"/Job.18.7\">Jb 18:7</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">צְעָדַי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 31:4\" href=\"/Job.31.4\">Jb 31:4</a>, etc.;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  lit. <em>step, pace</em>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 6:13\" href=\"/II_Samuel.6.13\">2 S 6:13</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּרְחִיב צַעֲדִי תַּחְתֵּנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:37\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.37\">2 S 22:37</a> = <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:37\" href=\"/Psalms.18.37\">ψ 18:37</a>, i.e. givest me firm footing, <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵיטִיבֵי צ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 30:29\" href=\"/Proverbs.30.29\">Pr 30:29</a> = <em>making a good step</em>, stately in march; <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 4:18\" href=\"/Lamentations.4.18\">La 4:18</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">לָ֑כֶת</span>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>step, steps</em>, in fig. of course of life, fortune: sg. <span dir=\"rtl\">לֹא יֵצַר צ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 4:12\" href=\"/Proverbs.4.12\">Pr 4:12</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">דֶּרֶךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 10:23\" href=\"/Jeremiah.10.23\">Je 10:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 16:9\" href=\"/Proverbs.16.9\">Pr 16:9</a>; pl. <a data-ref=\"Job 14:16\" href=\"/Job.14.16\">Jb 14:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 31:4\" href=\"/Job.31.4\">31:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 34:21\" href=\"/Job.34.21\">34:21</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">צַעֲדֵי אוֹנוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 18:7\" href=\"/Job.18.7\">18:7</a> (cf. <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 4:12\" href=\"/Proverbs.4.12\">Pr 4:12</a> supr.); <span dir=\"rtl\">מִסְפַּר־צְעָדַי אַגִּידֶנּוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 31:37\" href=\"/Job.31.37\">31:37</a>; of harlot <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 5:5\" href=\"/Proverbs.5.5\">Pr 5:5</a> fig., <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁאוֹל צְעָדֶיהָ יִתְמֹ֑כוּ</span>.","next":"BDB, צְעָדָה","prev":"BDB, צָעַד"}